sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User / Dashboard
    participant B as FastAPI
    participant RE as Risk Engine
    participant SH as SHAP
    participant DE as Decision Engine

    U->>B: GET zone risk
    B->>RE: predict(features)
    RE-->>B: score, confidence
    B->>SH: explain(zone)
    SH-->>B: SHAP contributions
    B->>DE: decide(score, trend)
    DE-->>B: role-specific actions
    B-->>U: risk + confidence + explanation + actions